{
	"info": {
		"_postman_id": "shareplate-api-2026",
		"name": "SharePlate API - Food Donation Platform",
		"description": "Complete API documentation for SharePlate Request Matching & Approval System\n\n## Setup Instructions:\n1. Import this collection into Postman\n2. Create an environment with variable: `baseUrl` = `http://localhost:5000`\n3. Register/Login to get JWT token (automatically saved)\n4. Token will be auto-applied to all authenticated requests\n\n## Features:\n- ✅ Authentication (Register, Login, Profile)\n- ✅ Donation Management (CRUD)\n- ✅ Request Matching (Full CRUD + Approval Workflow)\n- ✅ Auto-rejection mechanism\n- ✅ Role-based access control\n\n**Developed by:** Pinithi\n**Date:** February 26, 2026\n**Evaluation:** Component 1 - Request Matching & Approval",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
	},
	"auth": {
		"type": "bearer",
		"bearer": [
			{
				"key": "token",
				"value": "{{authToken}}",
				"type": "string"
			}
		]
	},
	"event": [
		{
			"listen": "test",
			"script": {
				"type": "text/javascript",
				"exec": [
					"// Auto-save token from login/register responses",
					"if (pm.response.code === 200 || pm.response.code === 201) {",
					"    const jsonData = pm.response.json();",
					"    if (jsonData.token) {",
					"        pm.environment.set('authToken', jsonData.token);",
					"        console.log('✅ Token saved automatically');",
					"    }",
					"}"
				]
			}
		}
	],
	"variable": [
		{
			"key": "baseUrl",
			"value": "http://localhost:5000",
			"type": "string"
		}
	],
